<title>USA: Delaware Otsego sets 5.0 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Delaware Otsego sets 5.0 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>COOPERSTOWN, N.Y. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delaware Otsego Corp said Thursday it had declared a 5.0 percent stock dividend to be distributed on March 31 to shareholders of record February 28.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be paid in cash, it added.</p>
<p>Delaware Otsego is a holding company whose principal subsidiary, New York, Susquehanna and Western Railway Corp, provides rail freight service to customers in New York and New Jersey.</p>
